{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_mberry_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_mberry_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"平安祈願","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_mberry_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"deddc71bb5b48f52252ca319919d83e6817b4c22c26419a495c4e6845cd81610","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_thundercloud"},{"type":"narration","text":"別......別開了。山路曲折，再往前開，說不定我們反而離那片雲更近。\n你看，大家都停在這路邊了。除了求那片天災雲別飄過來，我們也無法可想了。\n寧寧，不要打開車窗探頭探腦，拿著這個平安符，躲好。\n爸爸，媽媽，那個真的......是天災？可、可是......天災信使沒有提前警告大家呀？\n唉，天災信使也有預測不到的災禍。\n沒事的，我們一定不會有事的......寧寧，你會平平安安地長大的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......好大的風......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好消息是，至少雪已經停了，前方天氣晴朗，搜救受困人員的難度會大大降低。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根據向我們求助的商會提供的資訊，失蹤商隊最後一次發出訊號的位置在北面兩百里處，商會設立的冬季臨時營地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是在昨夜的大雪中，臨時營地的通訊也中斷了。我們需要先去確認情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，清點設備，確認防護服狀態。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題的話，大家把設備搬上車。雪天路滑，規劃好行駛路線。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打、打擾一下，請問應對凍傷和失溫的醫療用品，我準備的這些夠嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有什麼經驗，所以是按照培訓課程筆記準備的，不知道考慮得周不周到......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是第一次正式參與救援，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是的！我會努力不給大家拖後腿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，別緊張。你能順利完成培訓，成為“春乾”的正式成員，那救援任務就難不倒你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，藥物和器材配備齊全，數量也充足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有這個是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個，那個是信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長你出發時說過，無論什麼樣的任務，都要做好有去無回的準備，所以......所以我還是寫了留給父母的家書。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那個其實有些開玩笑的成分在裡面。不過，你願意做好心理準備，當然更好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......欸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣，我的手很熱吧？我會一點點發熱的源石技藝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看你一直抖得很厲害，現在是不是暖和一些了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，是的，不過我其實不冷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，沒事，不用謝我。覺得好一些了，我們就出發吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_ex1_snowmount"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當前風勢嚴重影響行動，步行進入山地搜救時，各位務必遵循救援準則，避免冒進行動！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，雪也大起來了！情況和氣象預測有偏差！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"臨時營地就在眼前了。抵達營地後，我們必須第一時間修復通訊基地台，聯絡指揮中心確認狀況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果惡劣天氣持續......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......必須考慮中止搜救行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我們需要延後進場時間。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有人......有人來了嗎？......救救我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那邊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"......救援隊？我、我等到救援隊了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"......求求你們！把我的父母救出來！還有商隊其他人！他們都還在大雪裡面！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別著急，我們就是來救人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寧寧，他凍傷很嚴重，需要護理和補充能量。看他有摔倒過的痕跡，你順帶檢查一下有沒有骨折。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，慢慢說，商隊其他人在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"（用力搖頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不知道。大家都在暴風雪裡走散了。我走了很久，最後發現自己一個人，繞回了營地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"我什麼都不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，那據你所知，暴風雪有引發附近的雪崩嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"應該......沒有。我沒有聽到雪崩的聲音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"但我也不確定，是不是風聲太大了，我錯過了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"不對，他們一定還活著，他們都是很老練的商人。商隊十一個人，怎麼可能只有我一個人倖存！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（隊長不說話了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（風聲......淒厲得可怕。我的牙齒在打架。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（以現在的能見度，就算不考慮深入山地有多危險，搜尋受困者的行動本身也近乎不可能。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（無人機無法放飛，無線電信號應該掃描不到，探照燈能探查的範圍也十分有限。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（但是，有經驗的商隊成員，應該會想盡辦法發出求救信號。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（如果他們有意識地製作信號旗，或者帶著求生哨和信號燈，被找到的機率會很大。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，你還不可以動！檢查還沒有結束呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"我感覺身體有些力氣了，我要去找他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，你只是身體稍微回溫了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且我剛剛確認過，你的雙腳腳腕都有扭傷，你只是被凍僵了才沒感覺到！快坐下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，別管我。你們不救人，我自己去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊、隊長......我控制住傷患了......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，怎麼辦才好......那些失蹤者一定還在雪地裡等著我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......通訊基地台修復了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稍等......有信號了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，我們已經與指揮中心聯絡上了，但是信號很不穩定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根據指揮中心的觀測分析，接下來兩小時內，降雪等級會降低，但長時間的天氣狀況他們無法預測。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"足夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寧寧，你留在這裡維護通訊基地台，將營地的帳篷修復一下，把傷患帶進去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用對講機和我們保持聯絡，我需要通過指揮中心傳來的即時資訊做後續判斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們一定要小心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_thundercloud"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑色的石頭落下來了，山被砸出了一道口子。\n沙石像瀑布一樣不斷滾下，巨大的噪音在山谷中回蕩。\n女孩捂住了嘴，呆呆地看著山谷對面道路上的車輛、山腳村莊的房屋，全部淹沒在崩塌的山石洪流裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g10_tent_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......這樣就可以了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"草藥敷好了，應該很快就能消腫。你的體溫，也已經基本恢復正常了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，還有，你餓了這麼久，可能暫時吃不下去食物，先靠營養液恢復一些能量吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和指揮中心的通訊也成功接上了，接下來，我們在這裡等待就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......隊長她從一開始就看出來我很害怕，所以讓我留在這裡。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我知道，這裡的工作也很重要，必須有人來做。我的臨場經驗不足，不適合去那麼危險的環境。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（可是，聽到隊長的安排時，我的第一反應居然不是不滿，而是鬆了口氣。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我這個樣子，算什麼救援隊隊員？我拿什麼去跟爸爸媽媽證明，我真的能堅持自己理想的職業？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——啊，打、打擾一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"非常抱歉，請暫時不要睡覺！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在沒有監測儀器，我需要對你的身體機能狀況再觀察一段時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......好。我只是，很累。我也......不想睡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"現在睡的話，一定會做很多噩夢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那你可以跟我說說話，我手頭上的工作只是維持通訊設備穩定運轉，不會被影響的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"你的臉色很難看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"你是專業人士，告訴我你的判斷。告訴我，他們是不是......已經救不回來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？不，不不不......我、我其實是在想別的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，我居然在這種時候走神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，是我應該道歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"我實在冷靜不下來，剛剛還對你們發火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我真的很怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"其實，這回是我想證明自己足夠有能力，不會給父母拖後腿，才硬要跟著他們的商隊過雪山。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，要是大家真的出了事......那不就全是我害的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我覺得......天降大雪，不是哪個人的錯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"可我總覺得，會下這場大雪，本身就要怨我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"不然......不然還能怨誰呢？老天爺嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"......風真大啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，風真大啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的心情，我好像也能理解一些......其實，我的爸爸媽媽也不願意讓我來做這麼危險的工作，畢竟，“天有不測風雲”嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是自己偷偷跑出來的。出來這麼久，他們也沒來過一封信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是現在出了什麼事，我的信被捎回家鄉......我也不知道，他們會是什麼反應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我也不想知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"寧寧，寧寧！聽得到嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我在！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請回報指揮中心，我們發現有積雪陷落痕跡，底部有熱影像反應，呼喚無回應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們需要指揮中心協助制定救援計劃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"氣溫......風力......陷落深度......積雪狀況......嗯，我都記下來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛我跟指揮中心聯絡過，現在後方技術組成員應該已經到崗了，我這就轉達訊息！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有......後半夜風雪會再次加大，你們記得及時趕回來哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你聽到了嗎？往西北方向前進的小隊好像發現失蹤者了哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......欸，睡著了。剛才我是不是說話太大聲了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，生命體徵平穩，沒關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以讓他好好休息一下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，呼叫指揮中心——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟、糟糕！信號中斷了！剛剛那陣風，應該影響到基地台了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"谷寧寧忍不住又望了一眼昏睡的傷患，接著看了看手裡的無線電對講機。\n她孤身一人，周圍只聽得見寒風的呼嘯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（用力搖頭）不要發抖！不可以發抖！也不要想什麼呼叫前輩回來幫忙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼都別想，將信號中斷的消息告知現場的大家，然後抓緊時間去維修！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......嗯，探照燈，護目鏡，防滑手套，安全繩，沒問題。培訓裡講解過這種案例。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"谷寧寧從行李中取出那封信，壓在貼身的口袋裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_ex1_snowmount_s"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（營地在避風處，但是基地台在那邊凸出的山頭......記憶中是這個方向。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗚......風太大了，眼前除了吹起來的雪，什麼都看不見了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（糟糕，這麼說，在外面的人處境更危險！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（所以，我、我不能慌張，不可以有差錯，萬一出了任何差錯......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不對。看好腳下，不可以東張西望！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，隱約可以看到通訊基地台的影子了。太好了，看起來沒有嚴重受損。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"報、報告隊長！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"基地台外部沒有受損跡象，我去檢查一下天線！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好，爬上去時小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......確認支點，移動安全繩位置......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（好冷。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（一抬頭，護目鏡上就落滿了雪，什麼都看不見......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（塔頂還有多遠？我已經爬了多高？演習中爬幾十米的雲梯，感覺也沒有這麼漫長呀......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（支架......是不是快被風吹倒了？還是說，是我自己的腿在發抖？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（對講機一直有響聲，應該是幾支分頭行動的小隊在互相通報平安。要是我在這裡浪費了時間，會不會讓他們遇到什麼不測......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不對不對，我在想什麼！我沒有緊張，我沒有緊張......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（想想解決問題的方法，對，我能解決問題！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（安全繩很牢靠，我出發之前檢查過。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（萬一摔下去，控制好身體，也能降低滑下山坡的機率。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（只要集中注意力，一步一步來，就不會出問題。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......摸到了！呼叫隊長，我已經爬上來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在檢查故障燈提示，定位故障線路位置！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好，接下來我遠端協助你排查線路問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不用慌張，大家現在都處於相對安全的狀態。二隊已經發現了兩名失蹤者，正帶著他們返回營地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們會合之後，就可以互相分擔一些工作了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你做得不錯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g10_tent_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，那位女士我也安頓好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目前救出來的受困者都沒有生命危險，真的太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，天也快亮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天氣快轉晴啦。太陽出來之後，救援和撤離都會更容易一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊員","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，感覺我又有勁啦！我再去幫三隊一把，看看情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，請多加小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"......他們還是沒回來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請、請不要自己起身走動！我能做的只是一些應急處置，你的傷勢還是需要靜臥恢復。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信“春乾”的各位一定會給你帶回好消息的，我們再等一等吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"你們多久沒闔眼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？嗯......只是熬一晚而已，沒關係的。這麼緊張的狀況，我也不太睡得著......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，畢竟是拯救他人性命這麼重要的事情，我覺得大家都很緊張，連後方指揮中心的協助者們也一直沒有休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別擔心，救援工作不會出現失誤的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼會想到加入救援隊？為了向你的父母證明自己？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，沒有沒有......是因為我小時候親眼目睹過天災吧，很小很小的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，我其實也不太想得起來，當時自己產生了怎樣的念頭。畢竟說到天災，我到現在都還是很害怕的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寧寧，準備加溫措施！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將這兩位受困者放置進睡袋時小心一些，我們盡力在戶外環境下維持他們的體溫了，但他們還是很虛弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"——爸，媽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是你的父母嗎？太好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你們！謝謝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們......成功救下了這些人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，那個時候......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_thundercloud"},{"type":"narration","text":"女孩以為，爸爸的大手很快就會伸過來遮住自己的眼睛，媽媽會說，天災很可怕，小孩子不要看，不要去想，會變成噩夢的。\n但是他們只是歎著氣，握住了她的手。\n“寧寧，記住這些災難，也是很勇敢的事情。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g10_tent_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個時候我只是想......我很害怕，很難過，也很無助，但我想記住。我想讓災禍帶來的痛苦減輕一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是爸爸媽媽教我的呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"......爸，媽，你們聽得見我說話嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"我給你們搓搓手，幫你們快些暖和起來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別激動，先讓我們採取醫療措施。你的父母還需要好好休息恢復，才能回應你的呼喚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"救援隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_798_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，搜救行動基本完成，從其他小隊彙報的情況來看，失蹤者的下落都已經找到，他們各自採取了非常有效的求救手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了......這樣一來，那封信也用不到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——終於可以鬆口氣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，對了，打擾一下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的受困者","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"谷寧寧拆開了寫著家裡地址的信封。\n信封裡空空蕩蕩，只有一枚平安符。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那個，這是一種祝福，平安順遂的祝福。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望你和你的父母，還有商隊的各位身體都能順利恢復。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本來我想把它還回去，但現在我想，這樣的希望傳遞下去更好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谷寧寧","speakerId":"avg_473_mberry_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後......我該好好給家裡寫一封信了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
